  {
    "description": "Store a relationship stated by the owner as a constraint, maintained automatically on later edits. Supported: align (targets: several parallel walls, kept collinear); center (targets: [opening, space]; the opening is centred on that space's segment of the wall); spacing (targets: [opening or wall, wall], params.distance in mm: clear distance from the opening edge to the wall face, or centre-to-centre distance of two parallel walls); size-target (targets: [space, optional wall], params.area in m², params.tolerance default 0.3). With hard=true, violating operations are rejected. source: user if the owner said it, agent if you inferred it.",
    "examples": [
      {
        "input": {
          "note": "门在房间中线上",
          "targets": [
            "主卧南墙·门",
            "主卧",
          ],
          "type": "center",
        },
        "note": "Centre a door",
      },
      {
        "input": {
          "note": "老人房一约 12 平",
          "params": {
            "area": 12,
          },
          "targets": [
            "老人房一",
          ],
          "type": "size-target",
        },
        "note": "Area target",
      },
    ],
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "hard": {
          "default": false,
          "type": "boolean",
        },
        "note": {
          "description": "Record in the owner's own words",
          "type": "string",
        },
        "params": {
          "additionalProperties": {},
          "default": {},
          "propertyNames": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "object",
        },
        "source": {
          "default": "user",
          "enum": [
            "user",
            "agent",
            "default",
          ],
          "type": "string",
        },
        "targets": {
          "description": "Object IDs or names",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "type": "array",
        },
        "type": {
          "enum": [
            "align",
            "center",
            "spacing",
            "size-target",
          ],
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "type",
        "targets",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "kind": "relation",
    "name": "constraint_add",
    "permission": "reversible",
    "runtime": "any",
    "title": "Add constraint",
  },
  {
    "description": "Delete a constraint.",
    "examples": [],
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "constraint": {
          "type": "string",
        },
      },
      "required": [
        "constraint",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "kind": "relation",
    "name": "constraint_remove",
    "permission": "reversible",
    "runtime": "any",
    "title": "Delete constraint",
  },
  {
    "description": "Record or update the owner's brief: household members, room list, preferences, budget, notes; the room program the interview arrived at (program: storeys, rooms by type, plot), which house_options builds from; and the styles the owner picked (style keys). Array fields and the program are replaced wholesale.",
    "examples": [],
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "budget": {
          "type": "string",
        },
        "household": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
        "notes": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
        "preferences": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
        "program": {
          "properties": {
            "floors": {
              "description": "Storeys above ground",
              "maximum": 3,
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer",
            },
            "plot": {
              "description": "Buildable area on the plot (mm), east-west by north-south",
              "properties": {
                "depth": {
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                  "type": "number",
                },
                "width": {
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                  "type": "number",
                },
              },
              "required": [
                "width",
                "depth",
              ],
              "type": "object",
            },
            "rooms": {
              "description": "Rooms wanted. Missing essentials (living room, kitchen, a bedroom, a bathroom per storey with bedrooms) are added",
              "items": {
                "properties": {
                  "area": {
                    "description": "Target net area, m²",
                    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                    "type": "number",
                  },
                  "floor": {
                    "description": "0 = ground floor; omit to let the generator choose",
                    "maximum": 2,
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "type": "integer",
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "description": "Name to write into the design, in the language the project data uses; default: the type",
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "enum": [
                      "living",
                      "dining",
                      "kitchen",
                      "master",
                      "bedroom",
                      "elder",
                      "kids",
                      "study",
                      "bath",
                      "storage",
                      "laundry",
                      "shrine",
                      "tea",
                      "family",
                      "garage",
                    ],
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                },
                "required": [
                  "type",
                ],
                "type": "object",
              },
              "type": "array",
            },
            "storeyHeight": {
              "description": "mm, default 3000",
              "maximum": 4500,
              "minimum": 2600,
              "type": "number",
            },
          },
          "required": [
            "floors",
            "rooms",
          ],
          "type": "object",
        },
        "rooms": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
        "style": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
          },
          "type": "array",
        },
      },
      "type": "object",
    },
    "kind": "relation",
    "name": "brief_update",
    "permission": "reversible",
    "runtime": "any",
    "title": "Record brief",
  },
  {
    "description": "Generate 2–3 different whole-house layouts from a room program (typologies: bar = a corridor between a sunny south band and a service band; hall = a central living hall through the depth with a wing either side; courtyard = one storey around a courtyard). Each option lists its footprint, gross area and every room with target and built area. Deterministic. Show the options to the owner and let them pick, then call house_build with the picked id.",
    "examples": [],
